        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Wait for Crocolisks in the City and repeat its fishing reward bag until this pet appears; a caged pet is an alternative.\n\n1. Choose the fishing-daily route in steps 2-6, or the optional Timewalking purchase in steps 7-8. For the daily, use a level-30-or-higher character with Fishing learned. Low fishing skill is sufficient for the baby-crocolisk catch; an old level-70 requirement does not apply in Retail.\n\n2. Visit Old Man Barlo at 38.6, 12.8 beside Silmyr Lake, northeast of Shattrath in Terokkar Forest. Accept Crocolisks in the City (11665). He offers one of five fishing dailies; if a different quest is offered, check again on another day. Enable Trivial Quests if his marker is hidden.\n\n3. With Crocolisks in the City active, fish in your faction's capital until you loot a Baby Crocolisk: Alliance can use Stormwind's canal near 67.9, 63.2; Horde can use the Valley of Honor waterfall in Orgrimmar around 60.3, 40.7. Keep casting in the water until the quest completes; the catch is not guaranteed on the first cast.\n\n4. Return to Old Man Barlo and turn in the quest. Open Bag of Fishing Treasures (35348). This is the crocolisk-reward bag; the similarly named 34863 from his other four dailies is not the pet-farming bag.\n\n5. If the bag contains Toothy's Bucket (33816), use that bucket from your bags and find Toothy in the Pet Journal. Learning another crocolisk does not collect this species.\n\n6. If the bag has no pet or a different crocolisk, repeat on another eligible character while the daily is offered, or wait for the next available day. The four possible pets are Toothy, Muckbreath, Snarly and Chuck. Duplicate species can drop before you complete the set.\n\n7. Optional Timewalking route: while Burning Crusade Timewalking is active, visit Cupri in Shattrath around 54.5, 39.0. Buy Bag of Fishing Treasures (35348) for 150 Timewarped Badges per bag. Check the item and price in the shop; this route does not require the fishing daily to be offered.\n\n8. Open the purchased bag and use Toothy's Bucket if it appears. Each additional bag is another random chance, not a selected pet. You can also learn a matching caged Toothy bought from another player instead of spending more badges or doing more dailies.",
