        name = "Phoenix Hatchling",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Farm Kael'thas for a random pet drop; Normal can be reset, and buying a tradable pet is an alternative.\n\n1. Go to Shattrath City and take the portal at 48.6, 42.0 to the ORIGINAL Isle of Quel'Danas. Post-Midnight Retail comments confirm that it still reaches the old island. Use that route for Kael'thas's old dungeon, rather than Midnight's new Magisters' Terrace.\n\n2. For repeat pet attempts, set Dungeon Difficulty to NORMAL and enter original Magisters' Terrace at 61.2, 30.9 on original Isle of Quel'Danas. Phoenix Hatchling drops on Normal and Heroic. You may instead do a daily Heroic run if you also want a chance at Swift White Hawkstrider.\n\n3. On Observation Grounds, defeat Selin Fireheart at 42.4, 22.3, then continue through the mana-wyrm hall to Vexallus at 83.4, 26.4 and defeat him. Finish any enemies keeping you in combat and follow the opened route toward the courtyard.\n\n4. On Grand Magister's Asylum, defeat Priestess Delrissa and ALL four companions at 39.7, 55.7. A surviving companion can leave the encounter unfinished. Continue to Kael'thas's chamber once the route opens.\n\n5. Defeat Kael'thas Sunstrider at 8.6, 50.2 on the same floor and loot him for Phoenix Hatchling (35504). If Gravity Lapse occurs, avoid the floating orbs and finish the fight. Whether he summons a phoenix does not guarantee the pet drop.\n\n6. If the pet drops, use the item and check the Pet Journal. Otherwise use the exit orb behind Kael'thas, leave, reset the NORMAL instance and repeat. If the game reports too many recent instances, wait for access to return. Heroic boss loot instead resets daily on that character.",
